 <body data-template-id="__page-root" style="background: rgb(243, 237, 227);">
  <div class="page-shell w-full">
   <header class="w-full px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 border-b hairline">
    <nav class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto flex items-center justify-between" aria-label="Primary navigation">
     <h2 data-template-id="brand-name" class="canva-text editorial text-xl font-semibold" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;">Medieval Peasant Life</h2>
     <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm"><a href="#daily-life" data-template-id="nav-daily" class="canva-link hover:opacity-60" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Daily Life</a> <a href="#village" data-template-id="nav-village" class="canva-link hover:opacity-60" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">The Village</a> <a href="#harvest" data-template-id="nav-harvest" class="canva-link hover:opacity-60" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">The Harvest</a>
     </div>
    </nav>
   </header>
   <main><!-- Hero -->
    <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-12 lg:pt-20 pb-16">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto two-col grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="reveal delay-1">
       <p data-template-id="hero-eyebrow" class="canva-text text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-5" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Life in the Middle Ages</p>
       <h1 data-template-id="hero-title" class="canva-text editorial text-[clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5.5rem)] leading-[.95]" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 34px;">The world of the medieval peasant.</h1>
       <p data-template-id="hero-copy" class="canva-text mt-6 text-lg leading-8 max-w-[520px]" style="color: rgb(90, 83, 71); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">For nearly a thousand years, peasants formed the backbone of European society — tilling fields, raising livestock, and sustaining kingdoms from the ground up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal delay-2 overflow-hidden rounded-sm"><img data-template-id="hero-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image w-full h-[420px] object-cover" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/27726410/pexels-photo-27726410.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=1280" alt="Lush golden wheat field with a clear blue sky">
      </div>
     </div>
    </section><!-- Stats -->
    <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-8 border-y hairline">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
      <div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-1-number" class="canva-text editorial text-3xl" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">90%</div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-1-label" class="canva-text mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Of population</div>
      </div>
      <div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-2-number" class="canva-text editorial text-3xl" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">14hr</div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-2-label" class="canva-text mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Work days</div>
      </div>
      <div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-3-number" class="canva-text editorial text-3xl" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">3</div>
       <div data-template-id="stat-3-label" class="canva-text mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Field system</div>
      </div>
     </div>
    </section><!-- Daily Life -->
    <section id="daily-life" class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-20">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto two-col grid grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm"><img data-template-id="daily-life-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image w-full h-[380px] object-cover" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/36540592/pexels-photo-36540592.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="A cozy rustic shed with vintage farm tools and a straw hat">
      </div>
      <div>
       <p data-template-id="daily-eyebrow" class="canva-text text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Dawn to dusk</p>
       <h2 data-template-id="daily-title" class="canva-text editorial text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1]" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;">A life governed by the seasons.</h2>
       <p data-template-id="daily-copy" class="canva-text mt-5 text-lg leading-8 max-w-[500px]" style="color: rgb(90, 83, 71); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">Peasants rose before dawn to tend crops, feed animals, and repair tools. Their days were shaped by sunlight, weather, and the liturgical calendar that granted rare days of rest.</p>
      </div>
     </div>
    </section><!-- Village -->
    <section id="village" class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-20 border-y hairline">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto two-col grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
       <p data-template-id="village-eyebrow" class="canva-text text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Community &amp; structure</p>
       <h2 data-template-id="village-title" class="canva-text editorial text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1]" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;">Bound together by land and lord.</h2>
       <p data-template-id="village-copy" class="canva-text mt-5 text-lg leading-8 max-w-[500px]" style="color: rgb(90, 83, 71); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">Villages clustered around a manor house and church. Peasants held strips of land in open fields and shared common pastures, with obligations of labor and rent owed to their feudal lord.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm"><img data-template-id="village-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image w-full h-[380px] object-cover" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/18381494/pexels-photo-18381494.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Idyllic street of traditional Cotswold stone cottages with lush greenery">
      </div>
     </div>
    </section><!-- Harvest -->
    <section id="harvest" class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-20">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto two-col grid grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm"><img data-template-id="harvest-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image w-full h-[380px] object-cover" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/11987205/pexels-photo-11987205.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="A serene scene of a wheat field at sunset with golden hues">
      </div>
      <div>
       <p data-template-id="harvest-eyebrow" class="canva-text text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">The crucial months</p>
       <h2 data-template-id="harvest-title" class="canva-text editorial text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1]" style="color: rgb(46, 42, 34); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;">Harvest — survival or famine.</h2>
       <p data-template-id="harvest-copy" class="canva-text mt-5 text-lg leading-8 max-w-[500px]" style="color: rgb(90, 83, 71); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">Late summer brought the most critical weeks of the year. Every able body joined to reap, bind, and thresh grain before autumn rains. A failed harvest meant hunger, debt, and death.</p>
      </div>
     </div>
    </section><!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-8 border-t hairline">
     <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto text-center">
      <p data-template-id="footer-credit" class="canva-text text-sm" style="color: rgb(107, 99, 86); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">© 2026 Medieval Peasant Life — An Educational Resource</p>
     </div>
    </footer>
   </main>
